g" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Maurice Bishop</span><span class="tp">1944–1983</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/samora-machel"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/samora-machel.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Samora Machel</span><span class="tp">1933–1986</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
